[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117067323","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108954#issuecomment-3117067323","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108954","id":3117067323,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65yqw7","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T09:29:41Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T09:29:41Z","body":"In my testing, the `begin` method sometimes received the window size from the project settings, sometimes the window size after resizing for embed game mode. If it was reliably the window size from the project settings, we could use it to force a video output resolution.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117067323/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3119006549","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108954#issuecomment-3119006549","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108954","id":3119006549,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc656ENV","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T16:04:27Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T16:10:07Z","body":"> In my testing, the `begin` method sometimes received the window size from the project settings, sometimes the window size after resizing for embed game mode. If it was reliably the window size from the project settings, we could use it to force a video output resolution.\r\n\r\nIt probably depends on whether you were done resizing the window by the time the first time was drawn. I guess we should always make it use the viewport size project setting instead, so that it's  more reliable.\r\n\r\n**Edit:** I pushed a second commit which does exactly that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3119006549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url"